- It's simple.

00:04:58.115 --> 00:05:02.077
You can download a celebrity's personality
and appearance into a blank robot.

00:05:02.160 --> 00:05:04.871
Hey, I have an idea. Let's do that.

00:05:08.166 --> 00:05:10.085
