pick me up a few credit card numbers.

00:05:24.474 --> 00:05:27.227
No way. Kirk could kick Picard's ass.

00:05:27.310 --> 00:05:30.188
Yeah? At least Picard had the guts
to admit he was bald.

00:05:30.272 --> 00:05:32.107
