00:17:07.177 --> 00:17:09.721
That coffin's not going to open itself.

00:17:09.805 --> 00:17:11.765
Bleh!

00:17:11.848 --> 00:17:13.767
Mmm!

00:17:14.893 --> 00:17:18.313
Let's hide in here.
It'll add to my box office gross.

00:17:18.397 --> 00:17:22.609
- Fry.
- Aw, you guys came to watch me make out.

00:17:22.693 --> 00:17:24.236
That is so sweet.

00:17:24.486 --> 00:17:28.365
Wait a second.
Is that the head of who I think it's of?

00:17:28.448 --> 00:17:31.535
Read the jar, Evelyn Wood. Dr. Z.

00:17:33.036 --> 00:17:35.956
Fry, a herd of Lucy Liu
are destroying the city.

00:17:36.039 --> 00:17:38.500
- Is yours acting normally?
- Let me see.

00:17:40.877 --> 00:17:42.796
Yep. Why do you ask?

00:17:42.879 --> 00:17:46.717
Mr. Mayor, if you want to see
the real vampire, look in the mirror.

00:17:46.800 --> 00:17:49.136
I can't. I'm a vampire.

00:17:59.563 --> 00:18:03.984
Oh! Why?

00:18:04.067 --> 00:18:06.945
And nappster says illegal copies
never hurt anybody.

00:18:07.029 --> 00:18:08.280
Quick! This way.

00:18:13.577 --> 00:18:16.038
Sorry, ladies. Employees only.

00:18:26.089 --> 00:18:30.761
Oh, no! They're forming
a human pyramid of robots.

00:18:33.096 --> 00:18:36.725
Damn it! We're weren't countin' on them
being as smart as they are sexy.

00:18:36.808 --> 00:18:39.061
A dangerous mistake to make.

00:18:40.604 --> 00:18:41.938
At least we've got food.

00:18:42.022 --> 00:18:45.025
- Dr. Zoidberg, cut open that bag.
- Hooray!

00:18:45.108 --> 00:18:46.109
And don't eat it.

00:18:46.401 --> 00:18:47.569
Oh...

00:18:48.862 --> 00:18:51.907
Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow!

00:18:51.990 --> 00:18:55.661
- Data error!
- Do not compute!

00:18:57.954 --> 00:19:01.249
Whoo-hoo!

00:19:01.333 --> 00:19:03.919
Life was bad, but now it's good forever.

00:19:23.230 --> 00:19:25.399
You'll be safe in here, sweetheart.

00:19:25.482 --> 00:19:28.485
- Get lost, Pavarotti.
- No.

00:19:30.570 --> 00:19:32.781
Lucy Liubot, if I don't survive the corn,

00:19:32.864 --> 00:19:35.617
I want you to know that I love you
as much as a man can love

00:19:35.701 --> 00:19:38.286
a computerized image
of a gorgeous celebrity,

00:19:38.370 --> 00:19:40.122
which, it turns out, is a lot.

00:19:40.205 --> 00:19:44.418
Oh, Fry. I love you more than the moon
and the stars and the...

00:19:44.501 --> 00:19:47.629
Poetic image number 37 not found.

00:19:52.009 --> 00:19:54.219
What are you doing, darling? Get down!

00:19:56.680 --> 00:19:59.933
Light hot. Oil temperature rising.

00:20:00.017 --> 00:20:03.562
Oh, no. Malfunction.

00:20:03.645 --> 00:20:06.815
This ain't good. System error.

00:20:10.527 --> 00:20:11.862
You saved us.

00:20:11.945 --> 00:20:15.407
- Are you all right?
- Yes, my love. I'll be just...

00:20:15.490 --> 00:20:19.161
Massive corn clog in port seven.

00:20:19.244 --> 00:20:21.872
- Are you the last copy of me?
- Yes.

00:20:21.955 --> 00:20:24.541
- Erase her, Fry.
- What? No!

00:20:24.624 --> 00:20:28.795
Fry, when you downloaded her
without my permission, you stole my image.

00:20:28.879 --> 00:20:30.964
And in the end, that's all I really have.

00:20:31.048 --> 00:20:34.051
That and the largest gold nugget
in the world, one mile in diameter.

00:20:34.134 --> 00:20:36.595
But I just downloaded her
because I love you.

00:20:36.678 --> 00:20:38.597
If you love the real Lucy Liu,

00:20:38.680 --> 00:20:41.975
and not just what you've seen in movies,
genre-straddling lawyer shows,

00:20:42.059 --> 00:20:45.312
and kiss-ass articles in People magazine,

00:20:45.395 --> 00:20:47.397
you'll blank out that robot.

00:20:56.990 --> 00:20:58.241
I'm sorry.

00:20:59.951 --> 00:21:01.286
Hug me, Liubot.

00:21:14.216 --> 00:21:17.177
I'll always remember you, Fry.

00:21:17.260 --> 00:21:20.347
Memory deleted.

00:21:21.473 --> 00:21:23.475
I know it hurts, buddy,

00:21:23.558 --> 00:21:27.020
but at least you're not in a sick
relationship with a robot anymore.

00:21:27.270 --> 00:21:28.271
Uh-huh...

00:21:28.897 --> 00:21:32.150
And I guess now maybe
I can get to know the real Lucy Liu.

00:21:32.234 --> 00:21:34.194
Yeah, at our wedding.

00:21:34.277 --> 00:21:37.572
It's true. Bender and I are in love.

00:21:37.656 --> 00:21:40.951
- But... But...
- Don't be a prude, Fry.

00:21:45.455 --> 00:21:47.541
Boy!